      "system": {
        "active": true,
        "description": "<p class=\"feature\">Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 10 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Slashing damage. If the target is a creature and doesn't already have an infernal wound, it is subjected to the following effect.</p><p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC 12.</p><p><em>Failure:</em> The target receives an infernal wound. While wounded, the target loses 5 (1d10) Hit Points at the start of each of its turns. The wound closes after 1 minute, after a spell restores Hit Points to the target, or after the target or a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to stanch the wound, doing so by succeeding on a ability check.</p>",
